I'm new today.

821
00:42:21.560 --> 00:42:23.910
They told me I should talk to you if I don't... have a...

822
00:42:23.910 --> 00:42:25.450
pack number...

823
00:42:25.450 --> 00:42:26.710
Who's they?

824
00:42:29.120 --> 00:42:30.670
Mr. Caputo...

825
00:42:30.720 --> 00:42:33.070
Please let me call me fiancée.

826
00:42:33.530 --> 00:42:35.710
Let him know that I'm okay.

827
00:42:36.850 --> 00:42:39.430
Two minutes. You got two minutes. that's it.

828
00:42:40.000 --> 00:42:42.750
Close the door. I don't want to run out my office.

829
00:42:49.570 --> 00:42:52.830
[clears throat]
Dial 9 to get out.

830
00:43:02.450 --> 00:43:03.940
Hello? Larry's phone.

831
00:43:03.940 --> 00:43:05.600
-Amy?
-Piper?

832
00:43:05.600 --> 00:43:06.570
Gimme the phone.

833
00:43:06.570 --> 00:43:08.290
One second. Can I say hello?

834
00:43:08.290 --> 00:43:10.640
Amy. I only have two minutes to talk.

835
00:43:10.640 --> 00:43:13.280
Are you okay? What's it like in there?

836
00:43:13.280 --> 00:43:15.110
Howard and I brought Chinese.

837
00:43:15.110 --> 00:43:17.110
Larry is so upset.

838
00:43:17.110 --> 00:43:19.110
-Let him talk. Amy.
Come on. gimme the phone.

839
00:43:19.110 --> 00:43:20.610
Amy. please let me talk to Larry.

840
00:43:20.610 --> 00:43:23.700
You know. I read that when Martha Stewart was in prison...

841
00:43:23.700 --> 00:43:26.680
-She foraged for dandelions.
-Okay. Um. please?

842
00:43:26.680 --> 00:43:29.830
-I was talking!
-Maybe it's not always about you dear.

843
00:43:29.830 --> 00:43:31.200
What's that supposed to mean?

844
00:43:31.200 --> 00:43:33.780
-Piper.
-I only have a minute now. I'm calling from the guard's office.

845
00:43:33.780 --> 00:43:35.780
Hey. Are you- Are you okay? What's going on?

846
00:43:35.780 --> 00:43:36.760
I love you so much.

847
00:43:36.760 --> 00:43:39.040
[laugh]
I love you too. Are you okay?

848
00:43:39.040 --> 00:43:41.740
I'm wearing granny panties and I've only spoken to white people.

849
00:43:41.740 --> 00:43:43.740
Huh. Are you joining the Aryan Nation?

850
00:43:43.740 --> 00:43:45.000
I don't know.

851
00:43:45.000 --> 00:43:48.380
But there's a nun here and you're not allowed to sleep in your bed. Only on top of it.

852
00:43:48.380 --> 00:43:49.410
That's weird.

853
00:43:49.410 --> 00:43:52.280
I know. right? And when I got here they gave me these little... uh...

854
00:43:52.280 --> 00:43:54.280
Bars of hotel soap and no shampoo.

855
00:43:54.280 --> 00:43:56.000
But I think that I can borrow some.

856
00:43:56.000 --> 00:43:58.000
From other... white people...

857
00:43:59.040 --> 00:44:00.920
I love you so much!

858
00:44:01.780 --> 00:44:04.990
[inhales]
One of my roommates had a massive heart attack when she got here.

859
00:44:04.990 --> 00:44:05.910
Okay.

860
00:44:05.910 --> 00:44:07.910
You are not allowed to have a heart attack.

861
00:44:08.200 --> 00:44:09.910
What did you have for dinner?

862
00:44:09.910 --> 00:44:12.490
Something my folks brought from the palace.

863
00:44:12.490 --> 00:44:14.840
Oh... The palace...

864
00:44:15.640 --> 00:44:17.530
Did you have a scary liver?

865
00:44:18.390 --> 00:44:20.170
And I insulted he chef.

866
00:44:20.680 --> 00:44:21.830
And...

867
00:44:21.830 --> 00:44:24.640
You're not supposed to eat the pudding because it's been to Desert Storm.

868
00:44:24.640 --> 00:44:26.640
Piper. listen to me. you cannot lose your shit.

869
00:44:26.640 --> 00:44:28.640
Okay? I mean it. please.

870
00:44:28.640 --> 00:44:30.640
Please tell me you're keeping it together. please?

871
00:44:30.640 --> 00:44:32.640
[inhaales] Please tell me you're okay?

872
00:44:33.050 --> 00:44:34.260
Wrap it up. Chapman.

873
00:44:34.260 --> 00:44:36.260
I'm... I'm Chapman here.

874
00:44:36.260 --> 00:44:37.750
You're my Pipes.

875
00:44:37.750 --> 00:44:40.440
Okay? And uh... I love you. And...

876
00:44:40.440 --> 00:44:42.440
[inhales] This is only temporary.

877
00:44:42.960 --> 00:44:44.970
That's what yoga Jones said.

878
00:44:44.970 --> 00:44:46.970
But it's just been one day and I can't...

879
00:44:46.970 --> 00:44:47.720
I can't.

880
00:44:47.720 --> 00:44:50.580
Piper. you can. You so can. Okay? You. you. you...

881
00:44:50.580 --> 00:44:53.100
Are so strong. babe. You...
[inhales]

882
00:44:53.100 --> 00:44:56.080
And you love adventure right? That's what got you in there and that's. that's...

883
00:44:56.080 --> 00:44:58.420
What's going to get you through this. It's all just a- a big adventure.

884
00:44:58.420 --> 00:45:00.940
With liver. and uh... yoga Jones.

885
00:45:00.940 --> 00:45:02.720
And. and. and... racism.

886
00:45:02.720 --> 00:45:05.180
You can come on Friday. Please come on Friday.
[inhales]

887
00:45:05.180 --> 00:45:08.160
Tell my mother to come on Saturday. and don't tell her you're coming on Friday. okay?

888
00:45:08.160 --> 00:45:10.160
Of course. Okay.

889
00:45:10.160 --> 00:45:11.710
Tue sleeps.

890
00:45:11.710 --> 00:45:13.260
That's it. Two sleeps...

891
00:45:13.260 --> 00:45:14.750
On top of your bed...

892
00:45:14.750 --> 00:45:16.580
And then. I will be there.

893
00:45:16.580 --> 00:45:18.360
Come on up on lights out.

894
00:45:18.360 --> 00:45:19.960
Say goodbye.

895
00:45:20.300 --> 00:45:21.160
[whispers]
I have to go.

896
00:45:21.160 --> 00:45:22.820
Hey. no crying.

897
00:45:22.820 --> 00:45:23.910
[whispers]
I'm Not crying.

898
00:45:23.910 --> 00:45:25.910
Piper. I love you. I will see you on Friday.

899
00:45:25.910 --> 00:45:27.630
Please. be brave.

900
00:45:27.630 --> 00:45:29.630
Don't let anyone into your granny panties.

901
00:45:29.630 --> 00:45:31.810
-I love you.
-I love you.

902
00:45:36.510 --> 00:45:38.170
Your head's not here yet.

903
00:45:38.630 --> 00:45:40.230
Don't worry. it'll catch up.

904
00:45:40.630 --> 00:45:42.230
In the mean time...

905
00:45:42.230 --> 00:45:43.550
Try to get some sleep.

906
00:45:43.550 --> 00:45:45.040
Before orientation...

907
00:45:45.040 --> 00:45:47.040
Which is tomorrow at 9...

908
00:45:47.040 --> 00:45:49.040
Shampoo for you.

909
00:45:51.170 --> 00:45:53.520
I think the words you're looking for are thank you.

910
00:45:53.860 --> 00:45:54.890
Thank you.

911
00:45:55.920 --> 00:45:57.590
Good night. Chapman.

912
00:46:01.310 --> 00:46:02.800
Close the door behind you.

913
00:46:15.570 --> 00:46:17.460
♪

914
00:46:21.470 --> 00:46:22.730
Chapman.

915
00:46:23.190 --> 00:46:25.130
-Hey. Chapman.
-What?

916
00:46:25.130 --> 00:46:26.850
-Rise and shine.
-What. what?

917
00:46:26.850 --> 00:46:28.850
You want time to shower and eat. you gotta get up.

918
00:46:29.830 --> 00:46:31.720
Aw... look at your eyes.

919
00:46:31.720 --> 00:46:33.490
You should put some cold water on 'em.

920
00:46:33.490 --> 00:46:34.640
Okay. Thanks.

921
00:46:34.640 --> 00:46:36.530
Take a nice shower. and get dressed...

922
00:46:36.530 --> 00:46:38.360
And you'll start to feel normal soon enough.

923
00:46:39.110 --> 00:46:40.650
Got flip-flops?

924
00:46:40.650 --> 00:46:41.460
No.

925
00:46:41.460 --> 00:46:42.890
Oh. honey.

926
00:46:42.890 --> 00:46:45.010
There's wicked fungus in the showers.

927
00:46:48.100 --> 00:46:50.450
♪

928
00:47:19.650 --> 00:47:22.920
♪

929
00:47:36.780 --> 00:47:39.130
Everyone gets a piece of fruit at breakfast.

930
00:47:39.130 --> 00:47:42.390
I'm telling you. It'll all start to feel normal soon. Really.

931
00:47:42.620 --> 00:47:43.710
You hungry?

932
00:47:43.710 --> 00:47:45.080
-I'm starving.
-Excuse me.

933
00:47:45.250 --> 00:47:47.080
Such pretty hair.

934
00:47:47.550 --> 00:47:50.240
When those roots start to show be sure to come and see me okay?

935
00:47:50.240 --> 00:47:51.960
I'll take good care of you.

936
00:47:51.960 --> 00:47:53.730
But even if you don't come to me...

937
00:47:53.730 --> 00:47:54.990
Don't go to Denita.

938
00:47:54.990 --> 00:47:56.990
She'll burn your shit out of your scalp.

939
00:47:56.990 --> 00:47:58.310
Go. Line's moving.

940
00:47:59.170 --> 00:48:00.950
Hey. Chapman. Are you Chapman?

941
00:48:00.950 --> 00:48:02.090
Yes.

942
00:48:05.530 --> 00:48:08.050
Red said she made that special for you.

943
00:48:08.050 --> 00:48:09.710
Wow! Thanks!

944
00:48:09.710 --> 00:48:11.260
Tell her I said... Thanks.

945
00:48:11.260 --> 00:48:13.600
I don't say nothin'. I'm just workin'. Next.

946
00:48:14.580 --> 00:48:16.180
Man. I'm tellin' you.

947
00:48:16.180 --> 00:48:19.040
Before my teeth got knocked out I had this awesome gap...

948
00:48:19.040 --> 00:48:20.710
Now they look like Chiclets! Look!

949
00:48:20.710 --> 00:48:23.340
You're crazy if you think you're beautiful...

950
00:48:23.340 --> 00:48:24.940
That you'll never get the food stuck in 'em...

951
00:48:24.940 --> 00:48:26.780
So you got the nice. fresh breath all the time...

952
00:48:26.780 --> 00:48:28.380
It's minty. and it's beautiful. it's like...

953
00:48:28.380 --> 00:48:29.870
God put them in you every day.

954
00:48:29.870 --> 00:48:31.530
Summer breeze is coming over here.

955
00:48:35.080 --> 00:48:36.280
♪

956
00:48:36.280 --> 00:48:38.060
Oh what did you do?

957
00:48:38.060 --> 00:48:40.060
She insulted the food in front of Red.

958
00:48:40.060 --> 00:48:43.160
Oh. jeez. I don't think you'll be eating for a while.
[laughs]

959
00:48:43.160 --> 00:48:45.160
Oh. Put it away.

960
00:48:45.160 --> 00:48:48.200
I'm enjoyin' menopause very much. Thank you. Whoo!

961
00:48:48.200 --> 00:48:50.660
You gotta think of how to make things right with Red.

962
00:48:50.660 --> 00:48:53.520
Oh. and yeah. You gotta go down to laundry. Don't forget that.

963
00:48:53.520 --> 00:48:55.350
And check the elastic on all the pants.

964
00:48:55.350 --> 00:48:57.470
Mm. Don't let the give you stretched out garbage.

965
00:48:57.470 --> 00:48:59.710
Oh. Orientation starts in 10 minutes.

966
00:48:59.710 --> 00:49:02.280
At least you had a nice shower this morning. right?

967
00:49:02.280 --> 00:49:03.770
Think I saw you in there?

968
00:49:05.200 --> 00:49:07.200
Um... I...

969
00:49:07.320 --> 00:49:10.190
I don't... I don't know... Um...

970
00:49:10.190 --> 00:49:11.160
Excuse me.

971
00:49:11.160 --> 00:49:13.800
Eh. eh. eh. Don't forget. You gotta brush your tray.

972
00:49:19.690 --> 00:49:21.760
Where's she goin' with that tray.

973
00:49:21.760 --> 00:49:23.420
Get the girl out of here!

974
00:49:23.420 --> 00:49:24.680
Eh. she'll figure it out.

975
00:49:24.680 --> 00:49:26.220
Did she go in the shower this morning?

976
00:49:47.530 --> 00:49:49.880
Maybe this is a bad time to say hi. huh?

976
